for i in range(2, 10, 2):
    print(i)

What will be the output of the following nested loop?

for i in range(1, 4):
    for j in range(i):
        print(j, end=' ')
    print()

Consider the following code. What is its output?

n = 3
for i in range(n):
    for j in range(n - i):
        print('*', end='')
    print()

